  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Advocating their Rights in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT: Improved governance regarding the rights of Lebanese and Palestinian youth in Lebanon

OUTCOME 1: Youth rights in Lebanon addressed, through advocating and campaigning the implementation of the national youth policy as well as Palestinian nurses rights, and breaking prevalent stereotypes between Lebanese and Palestinian youth in Lebanon.

OUTPUT 1.1: The Youth Forum further consolidated as a network advocating the implementation of the youth policy as a result of the development of a 5-year strategic plan, by-laws, and membership form
OUTPUT 1.2: Youth policy priorities are identified by the Youth Forum, well researched, presented to relevant duty bearers, digitally and theatrically promoted and campaigned.
OUTPUT 1.3: The members of Qindeel - The Network of Palestinian Nurses in Lebanon are capacitated to lead advocacy action over labor rights of Palestinian nurses in Lebanon.
OUTPUT 1.4: Human Rights for Palestinians are raised, discussed, and acted upon via conventional and artistic methods.

Target group: Lebanese and Palestinian youth in Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
